[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10681.269, "timestamp": "02:58:01", "text": "ダメージ。はい。よし。それは実際"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10682.95, "timestamp": "02:58:02", "text": "適切な量​​のダメージを与える"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10685.429, "timestamp": "02:58:05", "text": "今。えっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10690.87, "timestamp": "02:58:10", "text": "わかった。よし。ええと、以上です。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10693.269, "timestamp": "02:58:13", "text": "だから、これがうまくいくかどうかはわかりません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10694.63, "timestamp": "02:58:14", "text": "あなたのサイト。だから、君に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10696.23, "timestamp": "02:58:16", "text": "まずは1つ買ってみて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10697.99, "timestamp": "02:58:17", "text": "それは動作します。しかし、ダブルクリックすると"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10700.71, "timestamp": "02:58:20", "text": "猫シートを開くためのトークン。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10702.07, "timestamp": "02:58:22", "text": "わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10704.71, "timestamp": "02:58:24", "text": "次に、上部にある3つの点をクリックします。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10708.55, "timestamp": "02:58:28", "text": "それは、ええと、一番上の他の"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10708.86, "timestamp": "02:58:28", "author": "@Anti-SpiritArt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/wYaIbwf481rN5bfgaxWnbUoh-faRynKzhqgZXK5WIvlx9DlMJJl0M6boNmqYwDkmuSY99pM-=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Sop man"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10711.293, "timestamp": "02:58:31", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! Amartyajit~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10711.75, "timestamp": "02:58:31", "text": "オプション。装備ショップをクリックしてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10712.15, "timestamp": "02:58:32", "text": "うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10714.23, "timestamp": "02:58:34", "text": "あちらでは、それはあなたに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10716.63, "timestamp": "02:58:36", "text": "UIを購入する。えっと、こちらは購入できます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10718.389, "timestamp": "02:58:38", "text": "何でも。もしあなたが何でも買えるなら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10720.55, "timestamp": "02:58:40", "text": "あなたが望むもの。でも、とにかく試してみるといいと思います。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10722.309, "timestamp": "02:58:42", "text": "まず何かを購入して、それが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10724.07, "timestamp": "02:58:44", "text": "実際に機能する理由はわかりませんが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10725.75, "timestamp": "02:58:45", "text": "ブラウザによっては、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10726.79, "timestamp": "02:58:46", "text": "仕事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10729.99, "timestamp": "02:58:49", "text": "うん、何か買うものを考えてみて。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10731.91, "timestamp": "02:58:51", "text": "待って、更新したらどうなるか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10735.429, "timestamp": "02:58:55", "text": "ページ？ええと、何も起こりません。あなたと同じように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10737.11, "timestamp": "02:58:57", "text": "よろしければ試してみてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10739.59, "timestamp": "02:58:59", "text": "広告ブロッカーをオフにして、いいね"}]